  "subject": "A woman crouched at a Taichung station bicycle rack cannot recall her three-digit lock code, tries her birthday, her mother's and a stranger's, a crowd gathers with guesses, and a child finally tries 000, the factory setting she never changed.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien Latin boogaloo, 1960s New York Latin-soul shuffle with a hand-clapped backbeat. Piano playing a bouncing montuno in octaves; congas and timbales locking a cha-cha-tinged shuffle; trumpet and trombone horns punching short stabs between lines; electric bass walking a tumbao; handclaps on two and four. Live 1960s club mix, punchy horns, handclaps up front, plain close vocal. Female mezzo, bright and brash with a bounce, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 116 BPM, F major. Cheeky, bustling mood. No rap, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no synth pads, no EDM drop, no reggaeton dembow.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n腳踏車 鎖佇車架\n三碼的鎖 我袂記得\n欲轉去矣 日頭落山\n一个人蹲咧 旋鎖仔\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我先試 我的生日\n無 閣試 阿母的\n\n[Chorus]\n一二三 無 三二一 嘛無\n鎖仔鎖仔 你到底欲按怎\n一百 兩百 三百 攏無\n鎖仔鎖仔 予我轉去\n\n[Verse]\n賣報紙的阿伯 停落來\n講 試看覓 你翁的生日\n我講我無翁 伊就笑\n換一个少年 講 試看九九九\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n一个 兩个 三个人 圍倚來\n逐家 報一組 號碼\n\n[Chorus]\n一二三 無 三二一 嘛無\n鎖仔鎖仔 你到底欲按怎\n一百 兩百 三百 攏無\n圍一圈的人 嘛欲食飯\n\n[Verse]\n有一个囡仔 輕聲講 阿姨\n試看覓 三个零\n我講 袂啦 按呢敢有人\n喀一聲 鎖仔開開\n\n[Bridge]\n原來我 一擺都無改過\n三年 逐工 攏是 零零零\n\n[Chorus]\n三个零 三个零 原來是我\n鎖仔鎖仔 我三年無改\n一百 兩百 三百 免試\n逐家來 我請你食冰\n\n[Outro]\n零零零 零零零\n明仔載 我欲改做 一一一",
